    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "filing 2025 taxes. im a phd student, GRA with a stipend (W-2 from VT) and tuition is waived. got a 1098-T showing box 1 tuition and box 5 scholarships. does the tuition waiver count as income? using freetaxusa"
     ]
    },
    "status": "finished_successfully",
