    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "For a full-year Virginia resident with W-2 income only, the VA return (Form 760) is usually straightforward: it starts from federal AGI, and VA withholding from your W-2 box 17 applies. A few things to check in the software: the VA standard deduction, and whether you qualify for any VA subtractions (not common for a typical GRA). File both federal and VA in FreeTaxUSA. The state return has a small fee there."
     ]
    },
